<file path=".github/ISSUE_TEMPLATE/rocky-alma-installation-help.md">
  1: ---
  2: name: Rocky/AlmaLinux Installation Help
  3: about: Having trouble installing NFTBan on Rocky Linux or AlmaLinux?
  4: title: '[Rocky/Alma] Installation issue: '
  5: labels: rocky-linux, almalinux, installation, help-wanted
  6: assignees: ''
  7: ---
  8: 
  9: ## System Information
 10: 
 11: **Operating System:** (Rocky Linux 9 / AlmaLinux 9 / Rocky Linux 8 / AlmaLinux 8)
 12: **NFTBan Version:** (e.g., 0.32.5)
 13: 
 14: ## Installation Command You Tried
 15: 
 16: ```bash
 17: # Paste the exact command you ran here
 18: ```
 19: 
 20: ## Error Message
 21: 
 22: ```
 23: # Paste the FULL error message here
 24: ```
 25: 
 26: ## Pre-Installation Checks
 27: 
 28: Before opening this issue, please run these commands and paste the output:
 29: 
 30: ```bash
 31: # 1. Check OS version
 32: cat /etc/os-release
 33: 
 34: # 2. Check enabled repositories
 35: dnf repolist enabled | grep -E 'epel|crb|powertools'
 36: 
 37: # 3. Check for conflicting repos
 38: dnf repolist enabled | grep -E 'testing|modular|next'
 39: 
 40: # 4. Check for manual Go installation
 41: ls -la /usr/local/go 2>/dev/null || echo "No manual Go found"
 42: 
 43: # 5. Check golang package
 44: rpm -qa | grep golang
 45: ```
 46: 
 47: **Paste output here:**
 48: ```
 49: [paste here]
 50: ```
 51: 
 52: ## Have You Read the Installation Guide?
 53: 
 54: - [ ] Yes, I have read `/usr/share/nftban/docs/QUICK-START.md` (after install)
 55: - [ ] Yes, I have run `scripts/distro-setup/rocky.sh` or `almalinux.sh`
 56: - [ ] No, I haven't seen them yet
 57: 
 58: ## Common Solutions (Try These First!)
 59: 
 60: ### Solution 1: Enable EPEL + CRB Repos
 61: 
 62: **For Rocky/Alma 9:**
 63: ```bash
 64: sudo dnf clean all
 65: sudo dnf install -y epel-release
 66: sudo dnf config-manager --set-enabled crb
 67: sudo dnf distro-sync -y
 68: sudo dnf install -y nftban-x86_64.rpm
 69: ```
 70: 
 71: **For Rocky/Alma 8:**
 72: ```bash
 73: sudo dnf clean all
 74: sudo dnf install -y epel-release
 75: sudo dnf config-manager --set-enabled powertools
 76: sudo dnf distro-sync -y
 77: sudo dnf install -y nftban-x86_64.rpm
 78: ```
 79: 
 80: ### Solution 2: Disable Conflicting Testing Repos
 81: 
 82: ```bash
 83: sudo dnf config-manager --set-disabled epel-testing epel-modular epel-next epel-next-testing
 84: sudo dnf distro-sync -y
 85: ```
 86: 
 87: ### Solution 3: Remove Manual Go Installation
 88: 
 89: ```bash
 90: sudo rm -rf /usr/local/go
 91: sudo dnf install -y golang
 92: ```
 93: 
 94: ### Solution 4: Fix Package Version Mismatches
 95: 
 96: ```bash
 97: sudo dnf clean all
 98: sudo rm -rf /var/cache/dnf
 99: sudo dnf distro-sync -y
100: ```
101: 
102: ---
103: 
104: ## Additional Context
105: 
106: Add any other context about the problem here.
107: 
108: **Did any of the common solutions above work?**
109: - [ ] Yes, Solution #___ fixed it
110: - [ ] No, still having issues
</file>

