 893:     mode [MODE]         Set email alert mode (realtime|digest|both)
 894:     digest [ACTION]     Manage daily digest (status|send|clear)
 895:     help                Show this help message
 896: 
 897: NOTE: Login health checks are handled by 'nftban health check --auto-heal'
 898: 
 899: MONITORED SERVICES (auto-detected):
 900:     System:
 901:       • SSH (sshd)        - Failed/successful logins
 902:       • SU                - Switch user attempts
 903:       • SUDO              - Privilege escalation
 904: 
 905:     Email:
 906:       • Postfix           - SMTP authentication failures
 907:       • Exim              - SMTP authentication failures
 908:       • Dovecot           - IMAP/POP3 login failures
 909: 
 910:     Web/CMS:
 911:       • WordPress         - wp-login.php + xmlrpc.php attacks
 912:       • Roundcube         - Webmail login failures
 913: 
 914:     FTP:
