 924: 
 925:     All services use the same threshold for simplicity:
 926:       LOGIN_FAIL_THRESHOLD=5      # Failed attempts before ban
 927:       LOGIN_FAIL_WINDOW=300       # Time window (300 sec = 5 min)
 928: 
 929:     Override per-service in /etc/nftban/conf.d/login_thresholds.conf:
 930:       LOGIN_SERVICE_SSH_FAIL_THRESHOLD=3        # Stricter for SSH
 931:       LOGIN_SERVICE_WORDPRESS_FAIL_THRESHOLD=10 # More lenient for WP
 932: 
 933: TARGETS:
 934:     ssh                 SSH login monitoring
 935:     su                  SU command monitoring
 936:     sudo                SUDO command monitoring
 937:     console             Console/TTY login monitoring
 938:     service             Systemd service (default)
 939:     all                 All monitoring types
 940: 
 941: EXAMPLES:
 942:     # Quick setup (one command - enables all monitoring)
 943:     sudo nftban login enable
 944: 
 945:     # Check status (shows detected services)
 946:     nftban login status
 947: 
 948:     # Enable all monitoring types
 949:     sudo nftban login enable all
 950: 
 951:     # Disable login monitoring
