<file path="install/packaging/INSTALL_MAP.md">
  1: # NFTBan v1.0 - Installation File Mapping
  2: 
  3: **Version:** 1.0.0
  4: **Updated:** 2025-12-17
  5: **Package:** nftban (main package)
  6: 
  7: This document defines the **exact file mapping** from development repo to installed system.
  8: 
  9: **NO symlinks, NO patches** - files are copied directly to their destinations.
 10: 
 11: ---
 12: 
 13: ## Path Configuration
 14: 
 15: All paths are defined in `/etc/nftban/nftban.conf` via config variables:
 16: 
 17: | Variable | Default | Description |
 18: |----------|---------|-------------|
 19: | `NFTBAN_CONFIG_DIR` | `/etc/nftban` | Configuration files |
 20: | `NFTBAN_LIB_DIR` | `/usr/lib/nftban` | Library modules |
 21: | `NFTBAN_DATA_DIR` | `/var/lib/nftban` | Runtime state data |
 22: | `NFTBAN_LOG_DIR` | `/var/log/nftban` | Log files |
 23: | `NFTBAN_CACHE_DIR` | `/var/cache/nftban` | Cache files |
 24: | `NFTBAN_RUN_DIR` | `/run/nftban` | Runtime (PIDs, sockets) |
 25: | `NFTBAN_SHARE_DIR` | `/usr/share/nftban` | Static data |
 26: 
 27: **Scripts must use these variables** - not hardcoded paths.
 28: 
 29: ---
 30: 
 31: ## Installation Method
 32: 
 33: All files are **direct copies** (not symlinks):
 34: 
 35: ```
 36: SOURCE (repo)                          → DESTINATION (installed system)
 37: /home/.../nftban-v1.0-dev/cli/...      → /usr/lib/nftban/...
 38: /home/.../nftban-v1.0-dev/install/...  → various system locations
 39: ```
 40: 
 41: ---
 42: 
 43: ## Directory Structure on Installed System
 44: 
 45: ```
 46: /etc/nftban/                          # Configuration (user-editable)
 47: /etc/nftban/conf.d/                   # Modular config (watchdog.conf, etc.)
 48: /usr/lib/nftban/                      # Library modules (immutable)
 49: /usr/bin/nftban                       # Main CLI binary
 50: /usr/sbin/nftban                      # Symlink → /usr/bin/nftban (for backward compat ONLY)
 51: /usr/share/nftban/                    # Static data (templates, profiles)
 52: /var/lib/nftban/                      # Runtime state (mutable)
 53: /var/log/nftban/                      # Logs
