200: 
201: ---
202: 
203: ## Installation Commands
204: 
205: ### Install Library Files
206: ```bash
207: # Create directories
208: install -d -m 0755 /usr/lib/nftban/{core,cli,modules,helpers,lib,exporters,setup,tools,cron,bin}
209: 
210: # Copy library files (preserving structure)
211: cp -r cli/lib/nftban/* /usr/lib/nftban/
212: 
213: # Set permissions
214: find /usr/lib/nftban -type d -exec chmod 0755 {} \;
215: find /usr/lib/nftban -type f -name "*.sh" -exec chmod 0644 {} \;
216: find /usr/lib/nftban/bin -type f -exec chmod 0755 {} \;
217: ```
218: 
219: ### Install Configuration
220: ```bash
221: install -d -m 0750 /etc/nftban/conf.d
222: install -m 0640 -o root -g nftban install/config/nftban.conf /etc/nftban/
223: install -m 0640 -o root -g nftban install/config/feeds.conf /etc/nftban/
224: install -m 0640 -o root -g nftban install/config/conf.d/watchdog.conf /etc/nftban/conf.d/
225: ```
226: 
227: ### Install Systemd Services
228: ```bash
229: install -m 0644 install/systemd/*.service /usr/lib/systemd/system/
230: install -m 0644 install/systemd/*.timer /usr/lib/systemd/system/
231: install -m 0644 install/systemd/*.socket /usr/lib/systemd/system/
232: systemctl daemon-reload
233: ```
234: 
235: ### Install Main Binary
236: ```bash
237: install -m 0755 -o root -g nftban cli/sbin/nftban /usr/bin/nftban
238: ln -sf /usr/bin/nftban /usr/sbin/nftban  # backward compat only
239: ```
240: 
241: ---
242: 
243: ## Watchdog Files Summary
244: 
245: | Type | Source Path | Destination Path |
246: |------|-------------|------------------|
247: | Core Module | `cli/lib/nftban/core/nftban_watchdog.sh` | `/usr/lib/nftban/core/nftban_watchdog.sh` |
248: | CLI Command | `cli/lib/nftban/cli/cmd_watchdog.sh` | `/usr/lib/nftban/cli/cmd_watchdog.sh` |
249: | Config | `install/config/conf.d/watchdog.conf` | `/etc/nftban/conf.d/watchdog.conf` |
250: | Systemd Service | `install/systemd/nftban-watchdog.service` | `/usr/lib/systemd/system/nftban-watchdog.service` |
251: | Systemd Timer | `install/systemd/nftban-watchdog.timer` | `/usr/lib/systemd/system/nftban-watchdog.timer` |
252: | Runtime Dir | (created) | `/var/lib/nftban/reports/watchdog/` |
253: | Metrics File | (generated) | `/var/lib/nftban/metrics/watchdog.prom` |
254: 
255: ---
256: 
257: ## Verification
258: 
259: After installation, verify:
260: 
261: ```bash
262: # Check all watchdog files exist
263: ls -la /usr/lib/nftban/core/nftban_watchdog.sh
264: ls -la /usr/lib/nftban/cli/cmd_watchdog.sh
265: ls -la /etc/nftban/conf.d/watchdog.conf
266: ls -la /usr/lib/systemd/system/nftban-watchdog.service
267: ls -la /usr/lib/systemd/system/nftban-watchdog.timer
268: ls -la /var/lib/nftban/reports/watchdog/
269: 
270: # Test watchdog command
271: nftban watchdog status
272: ```
273: 
274: ---
275: 
276: ## NO Symlinks Policy
277: 
278: **All files are direct copies**, except:
279: 
280: 1. `/usr/sbin/nftban` → symlink to `/usr/bin/nftban` (backward compatibility)
281: 
282: Everything else is a **direct file copy** with proper ownership and permissions.
