718: COMMANDS:
719:     select              Interactive numbered menu (recommended!)
720:     list                List all feeds with status
721:     enable <feed>       Enable specific feed
722:     disable <feed>      Disable specific feed
723:     enable-cat <cat>    Enable all feeds in category
724:     update [feed]       Update feeds (all or specific)
725:     status              Show detailed status
726: 
727:     help                Show this help message
728: 
729: CATEGORIES:
730:     protection          General security & protection feeds
731:     ssh                 SSH attack protection
732:     web                 Web server attack protection
733:     email               Mail server & spam protection
734: 
735: EXAMPLES:
736:     # Interactive selection menu (RECOMMENDED!)
737:     sudo nftban feeds select
738: 
739:     # List all available feeds
