759:     • Use 'select' for easy numbered selection interface
760:     • Feeds are updated automatically if FEEDS_AUTO_UPDATE=true
761:     • Each feed has dedicated log at \${NFTBAN_LOG_DIR}/feeds.log
762: 
763: HELP
764: }
