104: 
105: ## Highlights
106: 
107: - **47 CLI Commands** — Complete firewall management from command line
108: - **Unified Go Backend** — High-performance feeds, GeoIP, and sync operations
109: - **Suricata Integration** — Intelligent rule management with 50-70% rule reduction
110: - **RBL Monitoring** — Real-time blackhole list checking and IP reputation tracking
111: - **Web Interface** — Modern dashboard for visual management
112: - **Dual-Table Architecture** — Clean IPv4/IPv6 separation with `ip nftban` and `ip6 nftban`
113: - **FHS Compliant** — Follows Filesystem Hierarchy Standard
114: - **Security Hardened** — Systemd sandboxing, capability-based permissions
115: 
