117: 
118: ## Core Features
119: 
120: | Feature | Description |
121: |---------|-------------|
122: | **Threat Intelligence Feeds** | Automatic blocking from Spamhaus, AbuseIPDB, Firehol, etc. |
123: | **Geographic Blocking (GeoBan)** | Block/allow traffic by country code |
124: | **Login Monitoring** | Detects SSH brute-force and suspicious patterns |
125: | **Port Scan Detection** | Automatic detection and blocking of reconnaissance |
126: | **DDoS Protection** | Rate limiting, SYN flood protection, connection limits |
127: | **Suricata IDS** | Optional deep packet inspection integration |
128: | **Prometheus Metrics** | Full observability for monitoring stacks |
129: | **Cloudflare Integration** | Auto-whitelist Cloudflare proxy IPs |
